'''Sabrina''' (Japanese: '''ナツメ''' ''Natsume'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Switch out your opponent's Active Pokémon to the Bench. ''(Your opponent chooses the new Active Pokémon.)''
}}

