==Trivia==
* This card's effect is identical to {{TCG|Pokémon Circulator}} and {{TCG|Repel}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but as a {{TCGP|Supporter card}} instead of an {{TCGP|Item card}}.
** This card's effect is similar to the Supporter cards {{TCG|Boss's Orders}} and {{TCG|Lysandre}} in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but this card allows the opponent to choose which benched Pokémon is switched in.
** {{TCG|Sabrina}} also exists in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but with a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Sabrina]] is a [[Gym Leader]] in [[Kanto]]. The interior of the [[Saffron Gym]], as depicted in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}, is featured in the regular print's illustration.

